### Get all companies
GET http://localhost:3030/api/companies
Accept: application/json

###

### Get company by ID
GET http://localhost:3030/api/companies/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a new company
POST http://localhost:3030/api/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Company",
  "description": "A company for testing",
  "founded_year": 2020,
  "industry": "Technology",
  "website": "https://testcompany.com"
}

###

### Update a company by ID
PUT http://localhost:3030/api/companies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Test Company",
  "description": "Updated description",
  "founded_year": 2021,
  "industry": "Updated Technology",
  "website": "https://updatedtestcompany.com"
}

###

### Delete a company by ID
DELETE http://localhost:3030/api/companies/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Search companies by name
GET http://localhost:3030/api/companies/search?name=Test
Accept: application/json

###

### Get companies by industry
GET http://localhost:3030/api/companies/industry/Technology
Accept: application/json
